            </div>
            <strong class="text-dark small">Interactive Chart.js analytics decks</strong>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="col-lg-7">
        <div class="row g-4 ps-lg-4">
          <div class="col-sm-6">
            <div class="med-card h-100 p-4 bg-white">
              <h5 class="text-dark font-weight-bold mb-3 small" style="color: var(--secondary) !important;"><i class="fa-solid fa-user-shield text-primary me-2"></i> Role Portals</h5>
              <p class="text-muted mb-0 small">Specialized interfaces for Patient booking, Doctor queue calling, and Admin operations management.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-sm-6">
            <div class="med-card h-100 p-4 bg-white">
              <h5 class="text-dark font-weight-bold mb-3 small" style="color: var(--secondary) !important;"><i class="fa-solid fa-gauge-high text-primary me-2"></i> Wait Estimation</h5>
              <p class="text-muted mb-0 small">Smart algorithm recalculates wait times dynamically based on average duration, completed reviews, and break schedules.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-sm-6">
            <div class="med-card h-100 p-4 bg-white">
              <h5 class="text-dark font-weight-bold mb-3 small" style="color: var(--secondary) !important;"><i class="fa-solid fa-chart-line text-primary me-2"></i> Advanced Metrics</h5>
              <p class="text-muted mb-0 small">Admin panel displays queue lengths, patient volumes, daily trends, and doctor workloads using interactive charts.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="col-sm-6">
            <div class="med-card h-100 p-4 bg-white">
              <h5 class="text-dark font-weight-bold mb-3 small" style="color: var(--secondary) !important;"><i class="fa-solid fa-handshake-angle text-primary me-2"></i> Doctor Autonomy</h5>
              <p class="text-muted mb-0 small">Doctors can accept or reject bookings with reasons, schedule breaks, skip absent patients, or call next with one tap.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- Specialties Section -->
<section id="departments" class="section-padding bg-light">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="text-center mb-5 max-width-600 mx-auto">
      <span class="text-secondary font-weight-bold text-uppercase small tracking-wider" style="color: var(--accent) !important;">Clinical Specialties</span>
